\"/wiki/%E5%8F%AF%E7%87%83%E7%82%B9\" title=\"可燃点\"><img alt=\"可燃点\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%AF%E7%87%83%E7%82%B9\" title=\"可燃点\">可燃点</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.7</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>旧卷新谈</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：307304</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3073/307304/可燃点-1技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3073/307304/可燃点-1技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3073/307304/可燃点-2技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3073/307304/可燃点-2技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3073/307304/可燃点-大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3073/307304/可燃点-大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3073/307304/可燃点-入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3073/307304/可燃点-入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">市井间，有胡人少女随商队而来。少女棕发碧瞳，身手敏捷，除弄丸寻橦外，尤擅幻术。无论她于何处演出，台下皆聚众观赏，喝彩声此起彼伏。<br />一日，只见戏台张灯结彩，敲锣打鼓，顷刻间，少女面带笑容登台而来，展挂一空白画卷，长约丈许。少女叠凳而上，信手泼墨作莲。未等墨干，少女翻手一指，张口一吐，焰火朵朵灼于卷上。少顷，火中翻出花瓣，娇艳如许，甚至有莲蓬微垂。时人皆以为障眼法，有好事者伸手触碰，却被火莲灼伤，不得不剪断烧焦的衣袖。<br />忽然间火光大作，胡人少女信步跃入火中。台下惊叫不已，却见少女于灰烬中走出，安然无恙。一时掌声雷动，无有质疑者。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"307304\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307307.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a6/Belonging-307307.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">镂空云纹丸铃<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Latticework Bell with Cloud Pattern</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />1<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>为跳丸之戏所备之鸣丸，内藏响铃。<br />游手弄丸，势若流星连缀，丸铃内蕴丹砂，引火升腾，随舞生焰，赫赫如火日轮转。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307308.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f4/Belonging-307308.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">彩绸双球流星索<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Colorful Silk Double-Ball Sling</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />23<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>长绸系彩结，彩结连流星。<br />索走游龙，巧蹙千回，戏风弄火，萧鼓齐鸣。曾于山野羁走兽，如今呈奇于市井。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307309.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/dc/Belonging-307309.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">铜铃铛鎏金环饰<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Gilded Bracelet with Bronze Bells</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />16<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>鎏金手钏与脚环，缀铜铃，西域幻人为杂耍百戏所备。<br />飞焰浮烟之间，但闻腕摇钏响，步转金鸣，锵锵脆音如乐。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%81%AB%E8%8A%99%E8%95%961.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 火芙蕖1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%81%AB%E8%8A%99%E8%95%961.jpg/203px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%81%AB%E8%8A%99%E8%95%961.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"203\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%81%AB%E8%8A%99%E8%95%961.jpg/305px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%81%AB%E8%8A%99%E8%95%961.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%81%AB%E8%8A%99%E8%95%961.jpg/406px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%81%AB%E8%8A%99%E8%95%961.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"1920\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%81%AB%E8%8A%99%E8%95%962.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 火芙蕖2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%81%AB%E8%8A%99%E8%95%962.jpg/203px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%81%AB%E8%8A%99%E8%95%962.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"203\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%81%AB%E8%8A%99%E8%95%962.jpg/305px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%81%AB%E8%8A%99%E8%95%962.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%81%AB%E8%8A%99%E8%95%962.jpg/406px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%81%AB%E8%8A%99%E8%95%962.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"1920\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">火芙蕖 <small style=\"color: grey\">Fire Lotus</small></span></span>"}}